## CSP Governance Gate — local pre-flight (VTID-03714 diff-only scan)
$ git diff origin/main -- 'services/gateway/src/frontend/' 'services/gateway/dist/frontend/' > /tmp/csp_diff.txt
$ node scripts/ci/validator-path-guard.cjs --csp-added-lines /tmp/csp_diff.txt
No CSP pattern hits in added lines.

First run of this command flagged 4 `.style` hits (three from
`.style.cssText` assignments in the new app.js "Steps" panel/heartbeat
code, one from a doc-comment in styles.css that echoed the literal string
"element .style property"). Fixed by moving every new element's styling to
CSS classes in styles.css (`.dev-autopilot-heartbeat`,
`.dev-autopilot-ghost-toggle`, `.dev-autopilot-steps-*`), mirroring the
VTID-03852 `.llm-provider-badge` precedent, and rewording the new
styles.css comment to avoid the literal `.style` substring.

